---
layout: layout.njk
title: 首页
---
<div class="page home"><section class="introduction"><h2><span aria-hidden="true">👋</span> 团队简介</h2><p class="intro-text">{{ site.about }}</p><p class="team-count"><strong>在校博士生：</strong>{{ team.doctoral }}<span> 名</span>，<strong>硕士生：</strong>{{ team.masters }}<span> 名</span></p><p class="faculty-inline">团队教师：<a href="{{ '/people/ren-yanzhen/' | relative(page.url) }}">任延珍</a>（教授、博士生导师）。</p>
<p class="intro-text">课题组研究经费充足，科研设备优良。</p>
<p class="intro-text"><strong>本科生科研实践：</strong>课题组同时招收动手能力强、具有科研兴趣的本科生进行科学研究实践，为优秀同学的继续深造和就业提供帮助和推荐。</p></section>
<section class="section news-section" id="news" aria-labelledby="news-heading"><h2 id="news-heading">🔥 News</h2><div class="news-scroll" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="2026 News"><ul class="news-list">{% for item in news.items | news2026 %}<li><time datetime="{{ item.date }}">{{ item.date | newsDate }}</time>: <span aria-hidden="true">{{ item.icon }}</span> {{ item.textZh or item.text }} <a href="{{ item.url }}">{{ item.title }}</a>{% if item.suffix %} {{ item.suffixZh or item.suffix }}{% endif %}</li>{% endfor %}</ul></div></section>
<section class="section" id="directions"><div class="section-title"><h2><span aria-hidden="true">🔬</span> 研究方向</h2><a href="{{ '/research/' | relative(page.url) }}">查看研究方向 →</a></div><div class="directions">{% for d in site.directions %}<article class="direction"><p class="eyebrow">{{ d.subtitle }}</p><h3><a href="{{ ('/research/#' + d.id) | relative(page.url) }}">{{ d.title }} ↗</a></h3><p>{{ d.description }}</p><ul>{% for topic in d.topics %}<li>{{ topic }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul></article>{% endfor %}</div></section>
<section class="section" id="publications"><div class="section-title"><h2><span aria-hidden="true">✨</span> 近期重点成果</h2><a href="{{ '/publications/' | relative(page.url) }}">全部论文 →</a></div><nav class="home-sections" aria-label="代表成果分类">{% for d in site.directions %}{% for area in d.subareas %}<a href="#selected-{{ d.id }}-{{ area.id }}">{{ area.title }}</a>{% endfor %}{% endfor %}</nav>{% for d in site.directions %}{% for area in d.subareas %}<section class="selected-group" id="selected-{{ d.id }}-{{ area.id }}"><h3 class="year"><span aria-hidden="true">{% if area.id == 'audio' %}🎙️{% else %}🎬{% endif %}</span> {{ d.title }} · {{ area.title }}</h3>{% set items = collections.featured | direction(d.id) | modality(area.id) %}{% include 'cards.njk' %}</section>{% endfor %}{% endfor %}</section>
<section class="section" id="resources"><div class="section-title"><h2><span aria-hidden="true">🗂️</span> 开放资源</h2><a href="{{ '/resources/' | relative(page.url) }}">查看全部资源 →</a></div><p class="intro-text">从真实通话中的伪造检测，到语音编辑定位与音视频识别，我们公开了相关数据集和研究代码。每个项目均说明研究内容与资源用途，方便选择和复现。</p><div class="resource-preview">{% for item in collections.resources %}<a href="{{ ('/resources/#' + item.page.fileSlug) | relative(page.url) }}"><strong>{{ item.data.resourceName }}</strong><span>{{ item.data.summary }}</span></a>{% endfor %}</div></section></div>